mapping "W5564.1" source="W5564" target="37383006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W5564 = Swedish national 4-digit extension of W55 SNOMED CT 37383006, qualified by place
        (industrial area/construction site) and activity (vital activity such as rest, sleep, meals,
        personal hygiene). International ICD-10 only has the 3-character W55, which Athena crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 4291007 (concept_code 37383006). No SNOMED CT concept models place- or activity-qualified
        exposure events as a single concept. Target fully subsumes the source (every such event is an
        exposure to attack by mammal); the place/activity qualifiers are not represented in SNOMED CT as a
        sub-concept. Broader mapping with moderate confidence: verified crosswalk from parent W55, but
        unspecified-source / national-extension qualification not independently re-verified in SNOMED CT
        hierarchy.
        """
}
